  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man with a beard and arms crossed, juxtaposed with text that reads: 'want to rape, steal & murder with no moral repercussions? then islam is definitely the religion for you.' This meme uses a dehumanizing and violent stereotype to associate Islam with criminal behavior and moral decay. The intent is to incite hatred and fear toward Muslims by implying that the religion inherently promotes violence and lawlessness, which is a harmful and hateful generalization. The visual of the man, combined with the text, is designed to provoke negative associations and reinforce Islamophobic tropes, specifically targeting Muslims as a group based on their religious identity. This constitutes a hateful message that attacks a protected characteristic (religion) and promotes prejudice against a specific community.",
